      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want to track `foundMatch` for stencils since they can\u0027t really have compatible overlaps as they would damage each other stencil content.\n\n*edit* or is this meant to return the oldest binding wrapper before we had an intersection, so it\u0027s really the kDisjoint case? If that\u0027s the case, then I don\u0027t think need match on the key?",
